>> /DA (/DJF 7.8 Tf 0 g) /DV (Evidence-based vulnerability discovery \204 agentic offensive tooling \(bug-reaper, MCP, LLM agents\) finds only real, exploitable bugs; every finding needs a working PoC and passes triage.\012Identity, access & API security \204 enforce SAML, OAuth, OIDC boundaries and deny-by-default principal isolation across multitenant products and integrations.\012Compliance & audit \(SOC 2\) \204 own SOC 2 Type II filing end-to-end: control mapping, evidence collection, gap closure, and auditor management.\012Secure SDLC & white-box testing \204 deep white-box and code-review testing across backend, API, database, and frontend, backed by automated CI/CD security verification.\012Cross-functional leadership \204 lead as QA Lead, product/compliance owner, and presales engineer, partnering with PMs, developers, and auditors.) /F 4 /FT /Tx 
